        "original_id": "e527cb96-18d3-5c4c-a5cd-257ca8b135f2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Peter Giunta, Tom Coughlin, Perry Fewell\n- Organizations: New Orleans Saints, New York Giants, Jacksonville Jaguars, New England Patriots, National Football League\n- Roles: American football coach, defensive backs coach, defensive coordinator, head coach, executive vice president of football operations\n- Events: Super Bowl XLII, Super Bowl XLVI\n\nFacts:\n- Peter Giunta was born on November 11, 1956.\n- Tom Coughlin was born on August 31, 1946.\n- Tom Coughlin was the head coach of the New York Giants for 12 seasons.\n- From 2006 to 2014, Peter Giunta served as defensive backs coach for the New York Giants under defensive coordinator Perry Fewell and head coach Tom Coughlin.\n- Tom Coughlin led the New York Giants to wins in Super Bowl XLII and Super Bowl XLVI against the New England Patriots.\n- Peter Giunta is an American football coach for the New Orleans Saints.\n- Tom Coughlin is the executive vice president of football operations for the Jacksonville Jaguars in the National Football League.",
